cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pq-migration-lab in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pq-migration-lab"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on lab for post-quantum cryptography migration, treating the problem
  as one of production engineering and crypto-agility rather than of algorithm
  implementation. Covers ML-KEM and ML-DSA in TLS and PKI, hybrid key exchange,
  certificate authority rotation, and the operational migration patterns and
  benchmarks that standards and reference implementations leave out.
authors:
